*Vow of Silence, when cast by a Whirling Wisp, lasts 9 seconds, which leaves a 1 {{1/4}} second window of opportunity for spellcasters. If the wisp uses other skills before reapplying Vow of Silence, it is occasionally possible, with precise timing, to use a 2 second casting time spell on the wisp.

